### 1. Criar o índice 'investments' com mapeamento de tipos (Text vs Keyword)
PUT http://localhost:9200/investments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mappings": {
    "properties": {
      "name": {
        "type": "text",
        "analyzer": "portuguese"
      },
      "description": {
        "type": "text",
        "analyzer": "portuguese"
      },
      "category": {
        "type": "keyword"
      },
      "broker": {
        "type": "keyword"
      },
      "value": {
        "type": "scaled_float",
        "scaling_factor": 100
      },
      "createdAt": {
        "type": "date"
      }
    }
  }
}

### 2. Inserir Documentos de Investimento
POST http://localhost:9200/investments/_doc/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "CDB Prefixado Master 14%",
  "description": "Certificado de Depósito Bancário emitido pelo Banco Master com rentabilidade fixa e garantia FGC.",
  "category": "Renda Fixa",
  "broker": "XP",
  "value": 5000.00,
  "createdAt": "2024-01-15T10:00:00Z"
}

